hello and welcome to PlayStation granade  Friday the 13th the videogame has  already become a cult classic for many  of us and although the launch was a  little flawed the service has improved  and continues to do so with new features  and bug fixes the devs aren't resting on  their laurels and are busy working on  new features so let's have a look at  nine new things coming to Friday the  13th the biggest news for me is the  introduction of a new Jason to play us  good media are keeping their cards close  to their chest but there are a few hints  that we can look into at present we have  Savini Jason which is a new skin created  for the games founders and retro Jason  designed to look like the Jason from the  NES version back in the 1980s the  full-fledged Jason's are from Friday the  13th part 2 part 3 part 6 part 7 part 8  and 2 part 9 so there's some gaps  missing in the lineage my guess would be  that Jason from Part 5 complete with the  blue Chevron's on his hockey mask yes I  know he isn't really a Jason but hey  cosplay is cool just in case you think  Friday the 13th is all about murder and  feast your eyes on some of the new  emotes being introduced to the game  we've only seen three thus far which  look like a way to beckon a counselor  over to your location  another looks like a flat-out refusal  and the third is a subtle celebration of  a job well done except for Tiffany who  gets who gets the all wrong come on look  there will be a total of eight free  communication emotes coming very soon  back to the gratuitous violence gun  media have revealed behind the scenes  photos of new kill animations coming to  Friday the 13th if you can make out what  the hell is going on here please let me  know except for this one this is  obviously Jason making a pinata out of a  counselor and looking forward to that  one  also coming soon our new outfits for  each counselor - brand spanking new ones  for each in fact some more opportunities  to look unique those of you who want  more clothing options or should I say  less clothing options then look no  further than the Spring Break 1984 [ __ ]  which lets all counselors strip down to  the  trunks and bikinis while being hunted by  Jason  sadly the spring break pack will cost  you real money but whether you spend or  not you will be receiving new cosmetic  items very soon if you are looking for  new destinations to hunt down teenagers  then rest assured that the devs are  working on new maps which will be taken  directly from the movies one of the most  requested locations is based on Jason  Takes Manhattan  part 8 in the saga tracking down pas de  father on the subways and the city  streets could be amazing but maybe a  little too unrealistic in addition new  fast-paced maps have been announced  allowing smaller groups to enjoy the  game instead of waiting for eight  players to join Peconic Crystal Lake and  Higgins Haven will be resized to allow  this the games balancing will also be  changed as a smaller map will help you  find items quicker but it also means  there's less room to escape Jason when  Friday the 13th release we were promised  a single-player campaign to get our  teeth into but over time this looked a  little too ambitious for gun media  months on and work is still underway to  bring us a one player option  but it is coming so we just need to be a  little bit more patient  another aspect promised before the  Friday the 13th release was a kill camp  theater at the end of each game to  showcase the brutal ways Jason took out  the teams this has been much harder to  follow up than I anticipated  but as of last month the highlight reel  function will be coming at the same time  as the single-player portion of the game  so fingers crossed we will still get  this we will soon be getting dedicated  servers for console players which should  mean the overall connectivity should be  improved and the hosts advantage will be  taken away at present host migration is  not being added so console players still  expect the whole stew leave the second  you kill them thus ending the game for  everyone and finally a physical copy of  Friday the 13th is arriving on October  the 13th and guess what it actually is a  Friday the 13th oh my god my OCD loves  that I know this isn't big news to us  because we have the game already but it  should open the door for many more  players hopefully frustratingly the  physical copy  with a new Jason - and new counselor  outfits but don't worry it isn't a full  fledge jason merely a bloody reskin off  part 3 Jason so there you have it 9 new  things coming to Friday the 13th are you  still playing Friday the 13th do you  still love it or maybe you're the one  who's thinking about joining the madness  at Crystal Lake soon I'd love to know  your thoughts about the upcoming content  I'm Adam from PlayStation granade it's  been a pleasure I'll see you next time  [Music]  [Music]
 

